    {
      "text": "game,",
      "start": 1692.0,
      "duration": 4.799
    },
    {
      "text": "I would say.",
      "start": 1693.84,
      "duration": 2.959
    },
    {
      "text": "FC, Rioan, Nightspun. That's what I",
      "start": 1699.2,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "would do here, I think.",
      "start": 1701.6,
      "duration": 3.679
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Or",
      "start": 1703.76,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "or you play a bit of feudal age.",
      "start": 1705.279,
      "duration": 8.601
    },
    {
      "text": "There is some merit to doing that, too.",
      "start": 1709.2,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Especially if he has front gold. If he",
      "start": 1716.48,
      "duration": 2.559
    },
    {
      "text": "has back gold, I'm just going to FC. But",
      "start": 1717.76,
      "duration": 2.88
    },
    {
      "text": "I think if he has front gold, I won't. I",
      "start": 1719.039,
      "duration": 4.161
    },
    {
      "text": "think then",
      "start": 1720.64,
      "duration": 5.12
    },
    {
      "text": "for sure you got to play the longer",
      "start": 1723.2,
      "duration": 5.56
    },
    {
      "text": "game.",
      "start": 1725.76,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Is that a front go? That's stone.",
      "start": 1731.919,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Okay.",
      "start": 1739.2,
      "duration": 4.479
    },
    {
      "text": "Might be gold down here",
      "start": 1740.799,
      "duration": 5.88
    },
    {
      "text": "maybe.",
      "start": 1743.679,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Is that a second gold?",
      "start": 1757.84,
      "duration": 5.48
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Yeah.",
      "start": 1760.32,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": ">> I didn't grab all my sheep around on my",
      "start": 1764.72,
      "duration": 3.36
    },
    {
      "text": "base yet. He has back gold.",
      "start": 1766.159,
      "duration": 3.441
    },
    {
      "text": ">> I don't know, man. He has two golds in",
      "start": 1768.08,
      "duration": 2.8
    },
    {
      "text": "the back plus woodline. I don't really",
      "start": 1769.6,
      "duration": 2.64
    },
    {
      "text": "want to play acro against that to be",
      "start": 1770.88,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": "honest. That's kind of an OP spawn right",
      "start": 1772.24,
      "duration": 6.76
    },
    {
      "text": "there. for",
      "start": 1774.88,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": "You're only",
      "start": 1834.24,
      "duration": 2.799
    },
    {
      "text": "Barely got any sheep this game.",
      "start": 1845.679,
      "duration": 7.081
    },
    {
      "text": "I think my scouting has been pretty bad",
      "start": 1848.32,
      "duration": 4.44
    },
    {
      "text": "in all honesty.",
      "start": 1856.72,
      "duration": 3.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Won't",
      "start": 1863.84,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Hot Let's",
      "start": 1922.08,
      "duration": 3.88
    },
    {
      "text": "just H up with one",
      "start": 1929.519,
      "duration": 3.721
    },
    {
      "text": "should be enough.",
      "start": 1933.36,
      "duration": 3.319
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Maybe it's going to be too slow",
      "start": 1944.32,
      "duration": 2.0
    },
    {
      "text": "actually. How long does it take to build",
      "start": 1945.279,
      "duration": 3.441
    },
    {
      "text": "the landmark?",
      "start": 1946.32,
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": ">> 3 minutes. I'm up before that.",
      "start": 1948.72,
      "duration": 7.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to pick two on it.",
      "start": 1951.84,
      "duration": 3.88
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Hinging up with one is so bad. Not if",
      "start": 1960.799,
      "duration": 4.401
    },
    {
      "text": "you FC.",
      "start": 1962.559,
      "duration": 4.401
    },
    {
      "text": "If you FC, it's smart because then you",
      "start": 1965.2,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "save resources",
      "start": 1966.96,
      "duration": 6.439
    },
    {
      "text": ">> instead of just waiting.",
      "start": 1969.12,
      "duration": 4.279
    },
    {
      "text": "Fore spechch.",
      "start": 1980.559,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't really know yet. Bark. I played",
      "start": 2023.44,
      "duration": 3.359
    },
    {
      "text": "one S Goku game in like three or four",
      "start": 2024.88,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Jin games.",
      "start": 2026.799,
      "duration": 6.36
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Jin still feels super weak.",
      "start": 2029.12,
      "duration": 4.039
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Something wrong with that.",
      "start": 2034.48,
      "duration": 3.559
    },
    {
      "text": "More",
      "start": 2043.44,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "some more food.",
      "start": 2056.639,
      "duration": 3.401
    },
    {
      "text": "12 months",
      "start": 2066.72,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "crazy",
      "start": 2069.679,
      "duration": 3.521
    },
    {
      "text": "a happy anniversary.",
      "start": 2071.28,
      "duration": 4.96
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Thank you so much, man. 12 months of",
      "start": 2073.2,
      "duration": 6.24
    },
    {
      "text": "support is crazy.",
      "start": 2076.24,
      "duration": 6.56
    },
    {
      "text": ">> I really appreciate it.",
      "start": 2079.44,
      "duration": 6.919
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Now he's making donos.",
      "start": 2082.8,
      "duration": 3.559
    },
    {
      "text": "He's",
      "start": 2088.96,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "going to push my gold. What is happening",
      "start": 2092.56,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "here?",
      "start": 2094.24,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Do I only have two? No, I have three.",
      "start": 2101.359,
      "duration": 4.121
    },
    {
      "text": "There's the last.",
      "start": 2112.48,
      "duration": 3.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Maybe I start archers.",
      "start": 2117.44,
      "duration": 7.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Nah, still not a samurai, right?",
      "start": 2120.0,
      "duration": 4.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Probably.",
      "start": 2124.96,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "just eight me",
      "start": 2148.079,
      "duration": 6.28
    },
    {
      "text": "go for the arch one.",
      "start": 2150.64,
      "duration": 3.719
    },
    {
      "text": "He's just spamming spears.",
      "start": 2167.839,
      "duration": 3.601
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't think I need this much on gold.",
      "start": 2205.68,
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "start": 2212.8,
      "duration": 3.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Let",
      "start": 2236.56,
      "duration": 1.92
    },
    {
      "text": "me see.",
      "start": 2240.64,
      "duration": 3.24
    },
    {
      "text": "You",
      "start": 2284.88,
      "duration": 2.16
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, I'm just being allowed to do",
      "start": 2310.32,
      "duration": 5.24
    },
    {
      "text": "whatever I want right now.",
      "start": 2311.599,
      "duration": 3.961
    },
    {
      "text": "So that should be pretty good for me.",
      "start": 2319.119,
      "duration": 7.281
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Full cabin. Maybe",
      "start": 2322.88,
      "duration": 6.239
    },
    {
      "text": "he's going to age up now. Wait, is he",
      "start": 2326.4,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "going forever?",
      "start": 2329.119,
      "duration": 5.321
    },
    {
      "text": "Is that a misclick?",
      "start": 2331.04,
      "duration": 3.4
    },
    {
      "text": ">> You know where you go from?",
      "start": 2339.52,
      "duration": 3.559
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, same man. I'm going to raid them",
      "start": 2356.32,
      "duration": 4.92
    },
    {
      "text": "after this game.",
      "start": 2357.76,
      "duration": 3.48
    },
    {
      "text": ">> I'm also going to go watch it",
      "start": 2365.359,
      "duration": 3.961
    },
    {
      "text": "behind",
      "start": 2370.48,
      "duration": 2.96
    },
    {
      "text": "This guy ain't having none of my",
      "start": 2372.079,
      "duration": 4.401
    },
    {
      "text": "[ __ ] with my uh cal. He's making",
      "start": 2373.44,
      "duration": 4.639
    },
    {
      "text": "musafi warriors.",
      "start": 2376.48,
      "duration": 5.639
    },
    {
      "text": ">> He's going to upgrade them with fumba.",
      "start": 2378.079,
      "duration": 4.04
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know about that. That's a little",
      "start": 2384.4,
      "duration": 7.16
    },
    {
      "text": "little out there in my opinion.",
      "start": 2387.599,
      "duration": 3.961
    },
    {
      "text": ">> We'll see.",
      "start": 2392.48,
      "duration": 3.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Uh, no food income right now. That's",
      "start": 2408.48,
      "duration": 7.24
    },
    {
      "text": "pretty bad. Let's try to fix that a bit.",
      "start": 2410.0,
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh [ __ ] he's still here.",
      "start": 2422.56,
      "duration": 3.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Move to the street.",
      "start": 2453.92,
      "duration": 3.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Two villager kills. That's good.",
      "start": 2469.92,
      "duration": 4.679
    },
    {
      "text": "need to find the final relic.",
      "start": 2500.48,
      "duration": 3.8
    },
    {
      "text": "He's still here. This guy",
      "start": 2507.2,
      "duration": 5.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Mona,",
      "start": 2529.52,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "that's scary.",
      "start": 2532.56,
      "duration": 3.32
    },
    {
      "text": "We're on four village kills.",
      "start": 2564.16,
      "duration": 3.959
    },
    {
      "text": "and five relics.",
      "start": 2577.28,
      "duration": 3.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh [ __ ] that scared me.",
      "start": 2585.599,
      "duration": 7.441
    },
    {
      "text": ">> I need a scout. AoE4 is giving me jump",
      "start": 2590.0,
      "duration": 6.04
    },
    {
      "text": "scares.",
      "start": 2593.04,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "He has a lot of fatty wars. I'm not",
      "start": 2602.4,
      "duration": 5.32
    },
    {
      "text": "going to lie.",
      "start": 2604.56,
      "duration": 3.16
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm just going to go back here. I don't",
      "start": 2650.72,
      "duration": 3.52
    },
    {
      "text": "need to push him. My push should be",
      "start": 2652.72,
      "duration": 4.52
    },
    {
      "text": "better.",
      "start": 2654.24,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to do",
      "start": 2704.4,
      "duration": 2.719
    },
    {
      "text": "Got a lot of stuff now.",
      "start": 2758.72,
      "duration": 3.8
    },
    {
      "text": ">> We can fight back.",
      "start": 2763.04,
      "duration": 3.039
    },
    {
      "text": "another.",
      "start": 2782.48,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Don't think I'm saving that.",
      "start": 2788.88,
      "duration": 6.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Hear",
      "start": 2791.92,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "me.",
      "start": 2795.599,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The guy is going to go like 100 Musafari",
      "start": 2817.76,
      "duration": 6.2
    },
    {
      "text": "warriors and then attack me.",
      "start": 2820.0,
      "duration": 3.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Why are you here?",
      "start": 2824.64,
      "duration": 3.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh my god. Freeborn.",
      "start": 2840.96,
      "duration": 3.56
    },
    {
      "text": "No, I don't have a scout with me here.",
      "start": 2865.92,
      "duration": 4.28
    },
    {
      "text": "That's a lot.",
      "start": 2873.92,
      "duration": 3.399
    },
    {
      "text": "Too",
      "start": 2884.8,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "much lag to kite.",
      "start": 2902.24,
      "duration": 3.8
    },
    {
      "text": "He's full melee, so he's going to have",
      "start": 2921.52,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": "some",
      "start": 2923.119,
      "duration": 6.121
    },
    {
      "text": "ineffective army. Probably",
      "start": 2925.2,
      "duration": 4.04
    },
    {
      "text": "I think I'm fine.",
      "start": 2929.92,
      "duration": 7.48
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Can't go full melee in this game.",
      "start": 2933.28,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": "That's GG now.",
      "start": 2941.52,
      "duration": 6.76
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Oh, there's a whole other army here.",
      "start": 2944.079,
      "duration": 4.201
    },
    {
      "text": "G.",
      "start": 2972.24,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": ">> I feel like I barely lost anything",
      "start": 2974.24,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "there.",
      "start": 2975.92,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": ">> But his army was so bad. It was full",
      "start": 2978.4,
      "duration": 3.36
    },
    {
      "text": "melee.",
      "start": 2980.24,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "You can't play like that.",
      "start": 2981.76,
      "duration": 3.599
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know. That was not really a",
      "start": 2984.16,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "game. That was kind of weird.",
      "start": 2985.359,
      "duration": 6.48
    },
    {
      "text": "just kind of dies tonight. Archer. Yeah,",
      "start": 2989.2,
      "duration": 5.6
    },
    {
      "text": "I barely lost anything.",
      "start": 2991.839,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "His rest gathered was way better than",
      "start": 2994.8,
      "duration": 5.92
    },
    {
      "text": "me, which is surprising",
      "start": 2996.559,
      "duration": 8.681
    },
    {
      "text": "because he just didn't even get full,",
      "start": 3000.72,
      "duration": 4.52
    },
    {
      "text": "but my units are better. So, yeah. I",
      "start": 3005.28,
      "duration": 6.279
    },
    {
      "text": "don't know.",
      "start": 3008.4,
      "duration": 3.159
    },
    {
      "text": "Yana",
      "start": 3027.599,
      "duration": 3.0
    }
  ]
}